BuildFreetokenForSpeed

This repository includes an unmodified source snapshot of FreeToken from
https://github.com/FlashML-org/FreeToken at commit
078132480ea4a0424f677a27eb22085624d331e6, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The upstream LICENSE and contributor documents are retained in upstream/FreeToken.

Local modifications are distributed separately in patches/series. The ordered
catalog is selected by integration/speed/current-release.json and its profile.
Customized FreeToken wheels are Speed builds, not official FreeToken releases.
Repository-owned tooling and patches are provided under the root Apache-2.0
LICENSE. Model weights are not included. Third-party dependencies and model
weights must be obtained and distributed under their respective licenses.

The native GGUF patches and MTP preparation tools include adapted components
from https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata at commit
6674a0065fb96bacde33e3eb10f91a1df86f95f2, including its pinned ggml-derived code
at 3cf03257f219afbe7334045ff7c6a06ac68c627d. These retain their MIT licenses and
attribution; this repository's Apache-2.0 license does not replace them.
The replayed FreeToken source and wheels include LICENSE-strata.txt,
LICENSE-ggml.txt and native component provenance. MTP reference source and
its LICENSE are retained in tools/mtp/references.
This integrates components into FreeToken and does not distribute the Strata
inference engine. Model resource license texts are in model-weights.
